Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["SaveData", "ObjectName",
 CellID->653,ExpressionUUID->"bcf6915e-f75e-42e9-9045-e0a812f0594a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"0845fc18-606a-4a44-bc96-d5afbbecc8f2"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
     "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   StyleBox["sol", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2b836634-e7bc-4944-b372-df139277a2f7"],
 "\[LineSeparator]writes ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["sol", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a50d0ec7-1f19-4118-9ba2-c116126c407f"],
 " and the evaluation notebook into ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$DataDirectory"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$DataDirectory", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "41d5ef92-6879-4a56-aa96-5361fe90c1ca"],
 "/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Alias"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Alias", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "5f51f9f4-abc7-47ae-8da4-38ba05bb8b2a"],
 "/",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["name", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "45ed3cb5-43e8-43a4-92ec-0f3eda84d313"],
 "/, and echoes the destination.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"6de9f766-d2b8-4737-9dc2-ccca192e5f03"],
 "The name is built from the first manifold's Name and Dimension, the first \
metric's Signature and the first chart's Name: an entry with a chart is a \
Sol, one without is a Thr.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"950eaf70-de86-44f2-af9b-87484be271d8"],
 "Every save stamps ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["sol", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "5fda860f-c87f-46fa-9cd5-25c939d9274a"],
 "[$info]: SolutionsX version, the saving alias (LastEdit), date, and the \
Wolfram and xAct versions. The stamp is machine-written and invisible to \
validation."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->654,ExpressionUUID->"949857e1-8c25-450b-b6a5-6c0d469fd9a3"],

Cell["\<\
SaveData[sol] writes Compress[sol] to $DataDirectory/$Alias/name/name.m and \
saves the evaluation notebook beside it as name.nb. It returns nothing: the \
destination is echoed.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->655,ExpressionUUID->"d9118f56-d6ba-4f10-813b-09ebc41c6bab"],

Cell["\<\
Every save stamps sol[$info] -- the SolutionsX version, the author (Author, \
set at the record's first save and preserved verbatim by every later one, \
whoever saves), the saving alias (LastEdit), the date, and the Wolfram and \
xAct versions in use. The stamp is machine-written, overwritten on each save, \
and invisible to validation: records without it load unchanged, and nothing \
ever inspects its content.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->656,ExpressionUUID->"351e8009-0e03-4528-88ad-646bcf2f038b"],

Cell["\<\
The name is built by inspecting the solution: the first manifold's Name and \
Dimension, the first metric's Signature, and the first chart's Name. An entry \
that has a chart is named Sol, one that has none is named Thr. So a theory \
becomes a solution precisely when coordinates are added.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->657,ExpressionUUID->"171bc4ff-02a6-41e4-a930-36cc85fabb3e"],

Cell["\<\
Signature 1 gives E and signature -1 gives L, as in Sol__4dL__Black-hole__FG.\
\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->658,ExpressionUUID->"f20cebee-d18b-4143-994e-b8632e0f4e84"],

Cell["\<\
SaveData takes no name argument. The name is entirely a function of the \
stored Name keys, so a solution built on a theory must have sol[$manifold, \
mani, Name] and sol[$chart, chart, Name] reassigned before the first save, or \
it will be written back over the theory it came from.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->659,ExpressionUUID->"85b00686-42ce-4958-8c94-322c1c88a0cd"],

Cell["\<\
SaveData refuses unless both $DataDirectory and $Alias are strings, and it \
asks for confirmation before overwriting an entry other than the one the \
current notebook belongs to.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->660,ExpressionUUID->"0c42b367-4654-4676-9cea-ead18994d170"],

Cell["\<\
Records are stored exactly as they live: nothing is wrapped or rewritten on \
save, and stored expressions sit inert until the entry's symbols are defined \
(the Grade guard makes the retrieval window safe).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->661,ExpressionUUID->"2808b3aa-3ce9-4b0d-804d-f4e23b2376f9"],

Cell["\<\
SaveData requires a front end, since it saves the evaluation notebook.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->662,ExpressionUUID->"3130cb2b-96a3-4e89-b775-8f07360f4523"],

Cell["SaveData has the attribute HoldFirst.", "Notes",
 CellID->663,ExpressionUUID->"d7632a4a-422f-4248-aab9-bb5737b49034"]
}, Open  ]],

